SUMMARY:Sister Trivia w/Dahmit Janet
DESCRIPTION:Join Sister Dahmit Janet for Sister Trivia \nShe’s bringing trivia as only she can with some amazing categories such as: the 2000s – Action movies – Name that Tune & more! Assemble your team and come on down!  The team that dominates all others to win will take home a prize! \nWe are raising funds for a wonderful Asheville-based charity organization: Arms Around ASD.  Arms Around ASD is a 501(c)3 organization dedicated to supporting the autism community through self-care and development of executive functioning skills to promote the growth of the community as a whole. \nTrivia is free to play – but if you feel so inclined\, please consider a $5-$10 donation in support of Arms Around ASD.  They do great work right here in Asheville\, for more information visit:  https://www.armsaroundasd.org/ \nWe’ll kick off the fun at 6 – so come on down to the Mule\, get together with friends and have a few laughs!  Be ready for trivia\, dad jokes\, and fun for all!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/sister-trivia-w-dahmit-janet/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends,Trivia
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://cooler-images.arryved.com/devils-foot-beverage-company/Mule-Sister-Trivia-117-DRAFT-2.png?width=1080&height=1350
END:VEVENT
