SUMMARY:FernGully: Live Film Score Performance with Sugar Bomb
DESCRIPTION:The Mule Invites You To This One-Of-A-Kind Event!\nSugar Bomb – Asheville’s own Experiment Jazz Trio – will perform live their interpretation of the animated classic FernGully’s score while the movie plays on the Big Screen. With their command of odd-time signatures and tonal textures\, this one-time event is not to be missed. Grab tickets now and secure a seat for what will undoubtedly be a memorable experience. All Ages\, so bring the family!\n\nDoors at 6pm | Show at 7pm\n Tickets & Info Here!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/ferngully-live-film-score-performance-with-sugar-bomb/
