SUMMARY:Artemis Collective Wild Pages Society Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Bring Your Own Book. We’ll bring the people\, the chaos\, and a new local spot to hang out in.\nWe’re putting a little twist on the traditional book club. \nNo assigned book.\nNo required reading.\nNo guilt if you haven’t read a single page this week. \nInstead\, bring whatever book you’re currently reading and come hang with us. \nTHE 2-HOUR FORMULA \nFirst 30 minutes — SOCIALIZE\nGrab a drink\, meet new people\, talk books\, make friends\, and settle in. \nNext 60 minutes — READ\nEveryone pulls out their own book and we have a cozy hour of reading together. Think communal reading date\, but with your new bookish friends. \nLast 30 minutes — THE CHAOS\nEvery meetup ends differently. We might play a ridiculous bookish game\, make a craft\, swap books\, shop from a local creator\, have a mini book discussion\, or just hang out and talk about what we’re reading. \nAnd here’s the fun part… \nWE’RE MOVING AROUND. \nEvery meetup will be hosted at a different local small business around Asheville + WNC. \nCoffee shops. Breweries. Bookstores. Wine bars. Cute little shops. Creative spaces. Places you may have never discovered otherwise. \nBecause we’re not just here to read books — we’re here to find our people\, discover new places\, and support the small businesses that make our community special. \nBring your current read.\nBring your personality.\nBring your weird book opinions. \nWe’ll bring the Artemis group chat energy. \nFind your people. Find your next book. Find your wild. \n$15 to join \n\n Tickets & Info Here!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/artemis-collective-wild-pages-society-book-club/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://cooler-images.arryved.com/devils-foot-beverage-company/10483.png?width=1536&height=2048
END:VEVENT
