SUMMARY:The Black Cat Market
DESCRIPTION:ASHEVILLE!  THE BLACK CAT MARKET IS BACK!\nJoin us FRIDAY\, NOVEMBER 13TH for an INDOOR vintage night market at @themuleavl !\nWe’re bringing together 10 vintage vendors featuring vintage clothing\, streetwear\, graphic tees\, jackets\, and rare finds! Plus food\, drinks\, and music while you shop. \n The Mule AVL | 131 Sweeten Creek Rd\, Asheville\, NC\n Friday\, November 13th 4–9 PM INDOORS RAIN OR SHINE! FREE ENTRY
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/black-cat-market/
