SUMMARY:FUEGO Metal Fest
DESCRIPTION:Get Ready To Experience The Fire\, Creativity\, And Raw Artistry Of Metal In All Its Forms!\nFUEGO Metal Fest is a celebration of the incredible artists and metalsmiths who shape\, forge\, weld\, hammer\, and transform metal into extraordinary works of art throughout Western North Carolina. From the roar of the forge to the intricate details of handmade jewelry\, this festival brings together the region’s metalworking community for an unforgettable showcase of craftsmanship and all things metal. Experience live blacksmithing and forge demonstrations\, discover one-of-a-kind jewelry and metal sculptures from talented metalsmiths\, and meet the artists behind the work. Whether you’re a seasoned metal head\, an art enthusiast\, a curious creator\, or simply someone who appreciates the beauty of handmade work\, there’s something here for you. \nIf it’s made of metal\, forged in fire\, shaped by hand\, or inspired by the art of making\, it belongs here. \nFree to attend.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/fuego-metal-fest/
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Free & Fun!,Live Music,Market
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://cooler-images.arryved.com/devils-foot-beverage-company/FUEGO-8.5x11-Instagram-Post-45-1.png?width=1080&height=1350
END:VEVENT
