SUMMARY:Second Annual Chili Chillout: The Mule Friendsgiving
DESCRIPTION:The Chili Chillout Is Back!\nDo you love chili? Do you love winning? Then this event is for you! Join us for a fun day of friendly competition as chili lovers bring the heat and compete for the second annual Chili Chillout cook-off bragging rights. The Hillclimbers will be back with us this year bringing the perfect live music Sunday vibes. Enjoy a variety of delicious chili\, football on the tvs\, and shop with local vendors offering spices\, sauces\, and more. All who attend will receive voting cards and get to pick the winner of three different categories: Best Traditional\, Most Unique Ingredients\, and People’s Choice. \nAll are welcome\, free to attend and eat. \nWant to make chili to share and take home the grand title? Email Hannah at themule@devilsfootbrew.com \nSee you soon!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/second-annual-chili-chillout-the-mule-friendsgiving/
CATEGORIES:Culinary Experience,Family Friendly,Free & Fun!,Fun & Games,Live Music
