SUMMARY:Bass Circus: Presented by Rat Lazer & Good Sweat
DESCRIPTION:What is Bass Circus?\nBass Circus Asheville brings together local EDM music\, movement arts\, and local trade under one roof. Our goal is to host an inclusive\, safe\, high-vibe event that highlights bass music\, showcases local performance talent\, and supports independent vendors and artisans. Graciously hosted by The Mule\, and curated by local DJs Rat Lazer & Good Sweat\, we invite y’all to come join us for this inaugural one-night spectacle! \nThis event is from 8p-2a\n Tickets & Info Here!
